  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个Serilum的模组。用心制作。大量活跃的Fabric、Forge和Neo模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于此模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">村庄钟配方是一个让游戏中的钟物品可以合成的模组。当其他模组需要钟物品时，或者你想用它们装饰基地但找不到村庄时，这个模组就非常有用了。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于Serilum的QoL捆绑包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg\" alt=\"描述\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配方需要4个石头、3个任意原木和1个金块：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/village-bell-recipe/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">结果：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/village-bell-recipe/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"632\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">悬挂时：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/village-bell-recipe/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"646\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，只要下载仍托管在CurseForge或Modrinth生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a>提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论已禁用，因为我无法在这么多单独的模组页面中跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
